      "translation": "死亡弩炮被摧毁了！守备队员们，冲锋！",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:7557a5d1fcf56765e18a6f80f1be51c6d9c9d40ceeb90997d410b12760a36862",
      "source_sha256": "96fca895c31af32c47f7c61c250214001223011ebf1fa237ebe28c39359a6ed0",
      "translation": "与此同时，青灵森林的朱特一行人……"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f403360098ce59a5d33a3d0c59dfab3b2dadc6d2f0dbf40605338dc3b89a48da",
      "source_sha256": "5756f75b1c185c6c3494dab57a3193f010b63d3de04c82bf07eda9f5c7ba5135",
      "translation": "(爷爷没事吧？先回村庄确认一下吧。)",
      "line_break_policy": {
        "source_count": 1,
        "target_count": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:de1c20395c76dbf8534d0105105647c8af178f5ad24ab28a7e3cc04c2cc70e78",
